\title{tardoc: Generate Documentation and Analytics for targets Pipelines}
\description{
Auto-generates documentation for targets pipelines across four tiers: (1) A self-contained HTML viewer with Fuse.js search and mermaid graphs; (2) A DuckDB WASM analytics viewer with full SQL, BM25 search, dplyr syntax, and recursive lineage queries — self-contained, opens as file://; (3) A Quack-protocol server analytics viewer with BERT semantic search (quackformers), FAISS ANN index, function call graph (sitting_duck), and git history (duck_tails); (4) An LLM chat interface over the pipeline database via ellmer, supporting OpenAI, Anthropic, Ollama, llama.cpp, and any OpenAI-compatible provider. The pipeline database is also exposable as an MCP server (duckdb_mcp) for use with Claude Desktop and Claude Code. When llm=TRUE, descriptions are auto-generated for undescribed targets and explanations added to function pages.
